# IMED Placement OS - Production Readiness & Security Plan

This document outlines the deep-dive research findings and the step-by-step implementation plan to transform the IMED Placement OS into a highly secure, robust, and fully interconnected platform suitable for college-wide production use.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Major Security Upgrade**: We will be adding Edge Middleware to completely lock down the application. Once implemented, it will be impossible to access any `/student`, `/admin`, or `/alumni` route without a valid session.
> 
> **Role Enforcement**: We will migrate the application to strictly rely on Supabase JWT `user_metadata.role`. This means a student cannot accidentally (or maliciously) access the admin portal.

