## Proposed Changes

### 1. Security & Edge Protection

We will implement impenetrable route protection and optimize the login flow.

#### [NEW] [middleware.ts](file:///c:/AI%20agent%20project/imed-placement-os/middleware.ts)
- Create a Next.js Edge Middleware to intercept every request.
- Verify the Supabase session token.
- Enforce strict Role-Based Access Control (RBAC):
  - Redirect `/admin/*` to `/login` if `role !== 'admin'`
  - Redirect `/student/*` to `/login` if `role !== 'student'`
  - Redirect `/alumni/*` to `/login` if `role !== 'alumni'`

#### [MODIFY] [app/login/page.tsx](file:///c:/AI%20agent%20project/imed-placement-os/app/login/page.tsx)
- Refactor the login logic to read the user's role instantly from `data.user.user_metadata.role`.
- Remove the sequential DB queries for faster, bug-free logins.

